  "body": "The return value of `BaseReadableStream.prototype.abort` is `undefined`, and `BaseWritableStream.prototype.abort` does this, according to the spec:\n\n```\n3. Return a promise resolved with undefined.\n```\n\nTo be consistent, shouldn't they return the same value?\n",
